      "message": "fix(ui): Setup -> Post page keeps a gap for the scroll bar\n\nThe properties pane scroll area kept no gap on the right, so the floating\nscroll bar could lie over the post option checkboxes and take the click.\nOne shared helper, layout::keep_scroll_gutter, now sets the gap for the\nproperties pane, the Post dialog and the operation page.\n\nPinned by setup_post_page_option_checkbox_is_clickable_when_the_page_scrolls.\n\nFixes #3390\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
